{"id":"e200883e5728e41f","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-cat2-right-kan-extension.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Right Kan Extension","display":"df-zfc-cat2-right-kan-extension — ZFC Cat2 Right Kan Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-right-kan-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-right-kan-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-right-kan-extension — ZFC Cat2 Right Kan Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-right-kan-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-right-kan-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-right-kan-extension — ZFC Cat2 Right Kan Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E,K,F,R,\\varepsilon\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E,K,F,R,\\varepsilon\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\)</span>（范畴、函子与自然变换谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2RightKanExtension}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2RightKanExtension}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}right\\text{-}kan\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2RightKanExtension}_S\n(R,\\varepsilon,F,K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,\nD_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D,\nE_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}K_0,K_1,F_0,F_1,R_0,R_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\langle E_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land K=\\langle K_0,K_1\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\n\\land R=\\langle R_0,R_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(R,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\n\\bigl(\\varepsilon,\\langle R_0\\circ K_0,R_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\nF,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall H,H_0,H_1,\\eta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH=\\langle H_0,H_1\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(H,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\n\\bigl(\\eta,\\langle H_0\\circ K_0,H_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\nF,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\to\\exists!\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\theta,H,R,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55mm}\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\n\\eta(X)=c_E\\bigl(\\langle\\varepsilon(X),\\theta(K_0(X))\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}right\\text{-}kan\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2RightKanExtension}_S\n(R,\\varepsilon,F,K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,\nD_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D,\nE_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}K_0,K_1,F_0,F_1,R_0,R_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\langle E_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land K=\\langle K_0,K_1\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\n\\land R=\\langle R_0,R_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(R,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\n\\bigl(\\varepsilon,\\langle R_0\\circ K_0,R_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\nF,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall H,H_0,H_1,\\eta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH=\\langle H_0,H_1\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(H,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\n\\bigl(\\eta,\\langle H_0\\circ K_0,H_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\nF,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\to\\exists!\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\theta,H,R,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55mm}\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\n\\eta(X)=c_E\\bigl(\\langle\\varepsilon(X),\\theta(K_0(X))\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The composite functors are explicit pairs of object and arrow maps.</li>\n<li>The factorization equation is expanded componentwise as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_X=\\varepsilon_X\\circ\\theta_{KX}\">\\(\\eta_X=\\varepsilon_X\\circ\\theta_{KX}\\)</span> using the composition map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_E\">\\(c_E\\)</span> of the fixed target-category code.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":""